#: appEditors/appGerberEditor.py:8224
msgid ""
"New diameter of selected plain circular flashes. Tracks and noncircular "
"features are skipped; shared apertures are not resized."
msgstr ""
"Nuovo diametro dei flash circolari semplici selezionati. Le tracce e gli "
"elementi non circolari vengono saltati; le aperture condivise non vengono "
"ridimensionate."

#: appEditors/appGerberEditor.py:8229
msgid ""
"Resize selected circular flashes about their own centers, as one undo step."
